# IDEA1 — LOCAL TEST FIXTURES ONLY (server/db/seedTestFixtures.js)
# Copy to a git-ignored .env.test (see root .gitignore: `.env*` except
# `.env.example` / `.env.test.example`) and fill in with the output of your
# local hash generator (never a raw password — see server/db/seedTestFixtures.js
# header for why).
#
# ⚠️ These three accounts are fixed, deterministic local test fixtures
# (admin_drive / staff_01 / staff_02) — never point DATABASE_URL at a shared,
# staging, or production database when running this. seedTestFixtures.js
# itself also refuses to run when NODE_ENV=production as a second guard.
TEST_SEED_ADMIN_DRIVE_HASH=
TEST_SEED_STAFF_01_HASH=
TEST_SEED_STAFF_02_HASH=
